Variable Tutorial

  This tutorial demonstrates passing values downstream between functions using variables within a
  Spring Boot application.

  Unlike direct method parameters, variables do not need to be passed explicitly by the caller.
  A variable set in one function is available for injection into any downstream function, allowing
  pipelines to be composed from independent classes that know nothing of each other.

  {{{https://github.com/officefloor/OfficeFloor/tree/master/tutorials/springboot/VariableHttpServer}Tutorial Source}}



