*@Val / In\<T\>

  The following method demonstrates reading variable values downstream.

%{snippet|id=tutorial|file=${basedir}/src/main/java/net/officefloor/tutorial/variablehttpserver/ValLogic.java|ignoreDownloadError=false}

  {{{/apidocs/net/officefloor/plugin/variable/Val.html}@Val}} annotates a parameter to receive
  the current value of a variable.  It distinguishes the variable from other injected objects such
  as <<<ObjectResponse>>>.

  The preferred combination is <<<Out\<T\>>>> upstream with <<<@Val>>> downstream — readable and
  avoids importing extra framework types at the read site.

